,"title":"AI watched 25 years of news. What did it see?","description":"What happens when you process 25 years of global news across 100+ languages through modern AI? In this keynote, GDELT Project founder Kalev Leetaru unpacks the hidden geopolitical and cultural trends uncovered from millions of hours of global media and the software engineering required to build it. Step under the hood of planetary-scale data architecture to see how real-time NLP, automated translation and petabyte-scale pipelines can transform decades of chaotic global noise into clean, queryable data that developers can use to build new intelligent tools.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T15:05:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T15:25:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"685b779a-20e7-4280-b402-b239764fb6d6","name":"Stage 10","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"5a1454c2-bc51-4fdf-aedc-bafafd80659e","name":"Kalev Leetaru","company_name":"GDELT","job_title":"Founder","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/3kzr7ns8hpghnnny44m00dtevcoo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/3kzr7ns8hpghnnny44m00dtevcoo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/3kzr7ns8hpghnnny44m00dtevcoo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/3kzr7ns8hpghnnny44m00dtevcoo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/3kzr7ns8hpghnnny44m00dtevcoo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Developer Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null}],"page":22,"nbPages":28,"maximumPages":32}}